            "text": "🤩 DOMiNO Ventures launches Acceleration Program «BetterFuture» to Empower AI Startups in Central Asia.\n\n⚡️ DOMiNO Ventures, a Dutch-based early-stage venture capital firm investing in AI, Gaming, and Web3 tech startups while supporting innovation and growth in the region, announces the launch of its BetterFuture AI Acceleration Program.\n\nThe program offers numerous advantages such as:\n▫️ equity investment opportunities;\n▫️ access to a wide range of global investors;\n▫️ gaining a valuable skill set to be used in the global startup arena;\n▫️ becoming a part of a strong alumni network.\n\n🚀 We are waiting for your applications!"
